      "description": "Root cause on the witnessed path. `mrb_vm_exec()` calls a helper that may re-enter the VM and move/free `mrb->c->cibase`, but vulnerable `OP_ARYCAT` does not refresh its local `ci` alias before later using `regs` derived from that stale pointer. The staged patch inserts `ci = mrb->c->ci;` immediately after this call."
